h contrast, sharp focus, dramatic lighting, rich textures, pristine edge definition, highly detailed, clean canvas, cinematic composition. --v 6.0 --style raw\nConstraints & Writing Style:\n主体聚焦：文字必须处于画面正中，字形结构在飘逸张扬的同时保留艺术辨识度。\n色彩与材质约束：严格锁定为“纯黑背景 (Pure black solid background)”与“金色墨水 (bright golden ink)”，利用极致的色彩对比突出张力。\n笔触细节：必须包含微观笔触细节，强调“飞白 (dry brush/Feibai)”、“运笔粗细变化 (thickness variation)”以及“动态张力 (dynamic tension)”。\n输出要求：直接输出最终拼接好的一段式英文提示词，不解释，不输出分析过程，不要有任何废话。\nWorkflow:\n获取用户输入的「文字内容」。\n将文字代入 Format Structure 的框架中。\n按结构顺序组合成一段流畅的英文提示词并直接输出。", "提示词优化", 0.6, 961285647, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "ref_image", "label": "ref_image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "video", "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_image1", "label": "ref_image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_image2", "label": "ref_image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_image3", "label": "ref_image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image3"}, {"widget": {"name": "api_baseurl"}, "name": "api_baseurl", "label": "api_baseurl", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "api_baseurl"}, {"widget": {"name": "api_key"}, "name": "api_key", "label": "api_key", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "api_key"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "role"}, "name": "role", "label": "role", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "role"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "link": 201, "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}], "flags": {}, "type": "RH_LLMAPI_NODE"